/S /H1
/P 69 0 R
/T (However, as discussed in a recent report of ours, ARMI may not always fully reflect the presence of particularly sensitive species. For example, the pollution-sensitive stone clinger \(flat-bodied mayfly\) has been recorded at Scribers Lane and The Dingles, but has not been found further downstream at Green Road or Blackberry Way. )
/E (However, as discussed in a recent report of ours, ARMI may not always fully reflect the presence of particularly sensitive species. For example, the pollution-sensitive stone clinger \(flat-bodied mayfly\) has been recorded at Scribers Lane and The Dingles, but has not been found further downstream at Green Road or Blackberry Way. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4 187 0 R 6]
