/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 73 0 R
/T (The Rea at Cannon Hill park displayed considerable variability, with ARMI scores ranging between 2-14. Particularly low values were recorded in late winter to spring this year, but seem to have picked up slightly as the year has gone on. Encouragingly, strong increases in ARMI scores were observed at the Stone Brook in Ley Hill Park recently, and to a lesser extent both sites along the Bartley Brook in Senneleys Park. )
/E (The Rea at Cannon Hill park displayed considerable variability, with ARMI scores ranging between 2-14. Particularly low values were recorded in late winter to spring this year, but seem to have picked up slightly as the year has gone on. Encouragingly, strong increases in ARMI scores were observed at the Stone Brook in Ley Hill Park recently, and to a lesser extent both sites along the Bartley Brook in Senneleys Park. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
