/Title (Although ARMI scores in the upper Tame tributaries were generally high, some declines were observed during summer months \(see right\). This was most clear in the Longmoor Stream, where ARMI scores dropped to, or below, the trigger level during the summers of 2024 and 2025, but this only happened once and recovered after.)
